# Cloud Run source deploy: whitelist only the files the Dockerfile needs.
# gcloud falls back to .gitignore when this file is absent, and .gitignore
# excludes dist/ (built locally before deploy). Keep the built output here.
*
!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!dist/
!dist/**
!public/
!public/**
!data/
!data/**
!prompts/
!prompts/**
